Mounting Procedure
==================

You can mount |product| with VESA mounting (:ref:`guide <vesa_mguide>`): **75 x 75** mm, 4 x **M4** (6mm) screws.

The |product| can also be mounted on the supplied desktop stand. A base stand is included by default. If you do not require the stand, please specify this when placing your order.

.. attention::

    Do not apply excessive mechanical pressure to the display when mounting it in an enclosure.

